IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STUDENTMARK.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 STUDENT-NAME      PIC X(20) VALUE "RAJESH".
       01 SUB1              PIC 9(3) VALUE 85.
       01 SUB2              PIC 9(3) VALUE 90.
       01 SUB3              PIC 9(3) VALUE 78.
       01 TOTAL             PIC 9(4).
       01 AVG               PIC 9(3)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE TOTAL = SUB1 + SUB2 + SUB3
           COMPUTE AVG = TOTAL / 3

           DISPLAY "STUDENT NAME: " STUDENT-NAME
           DISPLAY "SUBJECT 1: " SUB1
           DISPLAY "SUBJECT 2: " SUB2
           DISPLAY "SUBJECT 3: " SUB3
           DISPLAY "TOTAL MARKS: " TOTAL
           DISPLAY "AVERAGE: " AVG

           STOP RUN.

